xt": "on", "start": 86.242, "end": 86.362}, {"text": "the", "start": 86.362, "end": 86.462}, {"text": "planet's", "start": 86.462, "end": 86.862}, {"text": "surface.", "start": 86.862, "end": 87.462}]}, {"id": 34, "startTime": 87.462, "endTime": 89.442, "fullText": "They looked at each other in puzzlement.", "words": [{"text": "They", "start": 87.462, "end": 87.942}, {"text": "looked", "start": 87.942, "end": 88.122}, {"text": "at", "start": 88.122, "end": 88.262}, {"text": "each", "start": 88.262, "end": 88.422}, {"text": "other", "start": 88.422, "end": 88.622}, {"text": "in", "start": 88.622, "end": 88.762}, {"text": "puzzlement.", "start": 88.762, "end": 89.442}]}, {"id": 35, "startTime": 89.722, "endTime": 91.802, "fullText": "It's the computer, explained Zaphod.", "words": [{"text": "It's", "start": 89.722, "end": 89.902}, {"text": "the", "start": 89.902, "end": 90.002}, {"text": "computer,", "start": 90.002, "end": 90.562}, {"text": "explained", "start": 90.562, "end": 91.022}, {"text": "Zaphod.", "start": 91.022, "end": 91.802}]}, {"id": 36, "startTime": 91.802, "endTime": 95.022, "fullText": "I discovered it had an emergency backup personality that", "words": [{"text": "I", "start": 91.802, "end": 92.162}, {"text": "discovered", "start": 92.162, "end": 92.582}, {"text": "it", "start": 92.582, "end": 92.742}, {"text": "had", "start": 92.742, "end": 92.922}, {"text": "an", "start": 92.922, "end": 93.082}, {"text": "emergency", "start": 93.082, "end": 93.482}, {"text": "backup", "start": 93.482, "end": 94.022}, {"text": "personality", "start": 94.022, "end": 94.602}, {"text": "that", "start": 94.602, "end": 95.022}]}, {"id": 37, "startTime": 95.022, "endTime": 96.522, "fullText": "I thought might work out better.", "words": [{"text": "I", "start": 95.022, "end": 95.102}, {"text": "thought", "start": 94.942, "end": 95.302}, {"text": "might", "start": 95.302, "end": 95.562}, {"text": "work", "start": 95.562, "end": 95.822}, {"text": "out", "start": 95.822, "end": 95.962}, {"text": "better.", "start": 95.962, "end": 96.522}]}, {"id": 38, "startTime": 96.522, "endTime": 98.382, "fullText": "Now this is going to be your first day", "words": [{"text": "Now", "start": 96.522, "end": 96.982}, {"text": "this", "start": 96.982, "end": 97.182}, {"text": "is", "start": 97.182, "end": 97.342}, {"text": "going", "start": 97.342, "end": 97.462}, {"text": "to", "start": 97.462, "end": 97.582}, {"text": "be", "start": 97.582, "end": 97.702}, {"text": "your", "start": 97.702, "end": 97.842}, {"text": "first", "start": 97.842, "end": 98.142}, {"text": "day", "start": 98.142, "end": 98.382}]}, {"id": 39, "startTime": 98.382, "endTime": 101.022, "fullText": "out on a strange new planet, continued Eddie's new", "words": [{"text": "out", "start": 98.382, "end": 98.562}, {"text": "on", "start": 98.562, "end": 98.682}, {"text": "a", "start": 98.682, "end": 98.782}, {"text": "strange", "start": 98.782, "end": 99.122}, {"text": "new", "start": 99.122, "end": 99.382}, {"text": "planet,", "start": 99.382, "end": 99.942}, {"text": "continued", "start": 100.162, "end": 100.542}, {"text": "Eddie's", "start": 100.542, "end": 100.862}, {"text": "new", "start": 100.862, "end": 101.022}]}, {"id": 40, "startTime": 101.022, "endTime": 103.302, "fullText": "voice. So I want you all wrapped up snug", "words": [{"text": "voice.", "start": 101.022, "end": 101.382}, {"text": "So", "start": 101.382, "end": 101.942}, {"text": "I", "start": 101.942, "end": 102.022}, {"text": "want", "start": 102.022, "end": 102.162}, {"text": "you", "start": 102.162, "end": 102.302}, {"text": "all", "start": 102.302, "end": 102.502}, {"text": "wrapped", "start": 102.502, "end": 102.822}, {"text": "up", "start": 102.822, "end": 103.022}, {"text": "snug", "start": 103.022, "end": 103.302}]}, {"id": 41, "startTime": 103.302, "endTime": 106.042, "fullText": "and warm, and no playing with any naughty bug-eyed", "words": [{"text": "and", "start": 103.302, "end": 103.562}, {"text": "warm,", "start": 103.562, "end": 104.182}, {"text": "and", "start": 104.182, "end": 104.402}, {"text": "no", "start": 104.402, "end": 104.562}, {"text": "playing", "start": 104.562, "end": 104.842}, {"text": "with", "start": 104.842, "end": 105.042}, {"text": "any", "start": 104.602, "end": 105.382}, {"text": "naughty", "start": 105.382, "end": 105.642}, {"text": "bug-eyed", "start": 105.642, "end": 106.042}]}, {"id": 42, "startTime": 106.042, "endTime": 109.582, "fullText": "monsters. Zaphod tapped impatiently on the hatch.", "words": [{"text": "monsters.", "start": 106.042, "end": 106.762}, {"text": "Zaphod", "start": 106.762, "end": 107.642}, {"text": "tapped", "start": 107.642, "end": 108.002}, {"text": "impatiently", "start": 108.002, "end": 108.582}, {"text": "on", "start": 108.582, "end": 108.722}, {"text": "the", "start": 108.722, "end": 108.822}, {"text": "hatch.", "start": 108.822, "end": 109.582}]}, {"id": 43, "startTime": 109.582, "endTime": 110.922, "fullText": "I'm sorry, he said.", "words": [{"text": "I'm", "start": 109.582, "end": 109.782}, {"text": "sorry,", "start": 109.782, "end": 110.362}, {"text": "he", "start": 110.362, "end": 110.462}, {"text": "said.", "start": 110.462, "end": 110.922}]}, {"id": 44, "startTime": 110.322, "endTime": 112.742, "fullText": "I think we might be better off with a", "words": [{"text": "I", "start": 110.322, "end": 111.322}, {"text": "think", "start": 111.322, "end": 111.482}, {"text": "we", "start": 111.482, "end": 111.622}, {"text": "might", "start": 111.622, "end": 111.842}, {"text": "be", "start": 111.842, "end": 111.982}, {"text": "better", "start": 111.982, "end": 112.242}, {"text": "off", "start": 112.242, "end": 112.462}, {"text": "with", "start": 112.462, "end": 112.602}, {"text": "a", "start": 112.602, "end": 112.742}]}, {"id": 45, "startTime": 112.742, "endTime": 115.662, "fullText": "slide rule. Right, snapped the computer.", "words": [{"text": "slide", "start": 112.742, "end": 113.062}, {"text": "rule.", "start": 113.062, "end": 113.622}, {"text": "Right,", "start": 113.622, "end": 114.542}, {"text": "snapped", "start": 114.542, "end": 114.842}, {"text": "the", "start": 114.842, "end": 115.042}, {"text": "computer.", "start": 115.042, "end": 115.662}]}, {"id": 46, "startTime": 115.902, "endTime": 118.282, "fullText": "Who said that? Will you open the exit hatch,", "words": [{"text": "Who", "start": 115.902, "end": 116.042}, {"text": "said", "start": 116.042, "end": 116.242}, {"text": "that?", "start": 116.242, "end": 116.702}, {"text": "Will", "start": 116.702, "end": 117.122}, {"text": "you", "start": 117.122, "end": 117.242}, {"text": "open", "start": 117.242, "end": 117.462}, {"text": "the", "start": 117.462, "end": 117.602}, {"text": "exit", "start": 117.602, "end": 117.862}, {"text": "hatch,", "start": 117.862, "end": 118.282}]}, {"id": 47, "startTime": 118.282, "endTime": 121.882, "fullText": "please, computer? Said Zaphod, trying not to get angry.", "words": [{"text": "please,", "start": 118.282, "end": 118.762}, {"text": "computer?", "start": 118.762, "end": 119.282}, {"text": "Said", "start": 119.282, "end": 119.822}, {"text": "Zaphod,", "start": 119.822, "end": 120.462}, {"text": "trying", "start": 120.462, "end": 120.662}, {"text": "not", "start": 120.662, "end": 120.842}, {"text": "to", "start": 120.842, "end": 120.982}, {"text": "get", "start": 120.502, "end": 121.142}, {"text": "angry.", "start": 121.142, "end": 121.882}]}, {"id": 48, "startTime": 121.882, "endTime": 123.802, "fullText": "Not until whoever said that owns up,", "words": [{"text": "Not", "start": 121.882, "end": 122.102}, {"text": "until", "start": 122.102, "end": 122.362}, {"text": "whoever", "start": 122.362, "end": 122.642}, {"text": "said", "start": 122.642, "end": 122.982}, {"text": "that", "start": 122.982, "end": 123.182}, {"text": "owns", "start": 123.182, "end": 123.362}, {"text": "up,", "start": 123.362, "end": 123.802}]}, {"id": 49, "startTime": 123.802, "endTime": 127.002, "fullText": "urged the computer, stamping a few synapses closed.", "words": [{"text": "urged", "start": 123.802, "end": 124.182}, {"text": "the", "start": 124.182, "end": 124.342}, {"text": "computer,", "start": 124.342, "end": 125.182}, {"text": "stamping", "start": 125.182, "end": 125.422}, {"text": "a", "start": 125.422, "end": 125.642}, {"text": "few", "start": 125.642, "end": 125.842}, {"text": "synapses", "start": 125.842, "end": 126.342}, {"text": "closed.", "start": 126.342, "end": 127.002}]}, {"id": 50, "startTime": 127.382, "endTime": 130.422, "fullText": "Oh God, muttered Ford, slumped against a bulkhead and", "words": [{"text": "Oh", "start": 127.382, "end": 127.522}, {"text": "God,", "start": 127.522, "end": 128.062}, {"text": "muttered", "start": 128.062, "end": 128.402}, {"text": "Ford,", "start": 128.402, "end": 129.202}, {"text": "slumped", "start": 129.202, "end": 129.462}, {"text": "against", "start": 129.462, "end": 129.642}, {"text": "a", "start": 129.642, "end": 129.822}, {"text": "bulkhead", "start": 129.822, "end": 130.242}, {"text": "and", "start": 130.242, "end": 130.422}]}, {"id": 51, "startTime": 130.422, "endTime": 131.702, "fullText": "started to count to ten.", "words": [{"text": "started", "start": 130.422, "end": 130.722}, {"text": "to", "start": 130.722, "end": 130.882}, {"text": "count", "start": 130.882, "end": 131.082}, {"text": "to", "start": 131.082, "end": 131.262}, {"text": "ten.", "start": 131.262, "end": 131.702}]}, {"id": 52, "startTime": 132.002, "endTime": 134.002, "fullText": "He was desperately worried that one day,", "words": [{"text": "He", "start": 132.002, "end": 132.122}, {"text": "was", "start": 132.122, "end": 132.282}, {"text": "desperately", "start": 132.282, "end": 132.702}, {"text": "worried", "start": 132.702, "end": 133.182}, {"text": "that", "start": 133.182, "end": 133.402}, {"text": "one", "start": 133.402, "end": 133.582}, {"text": "day,", "start": 133.582, "end": 134.002}]}, {"id": 53, "startTime": 134.002, "endTime": 136.282, "fullText": "sentient life forms would forget how to do this.", "words": [{"text": "sentient", "start": 134.002, "end": 134.242}, {"text": "life", "start": 134.242, "end": 134.562}, {"text": "forms", "start": 134.562, "end": 134.922}, {"text": "would", "start": 134.922, "end": 135.142}, {"text": "forget", "start": 135.142, "end": 135.382}, {"text": "how", "start": 135.382, "end": 135.582}, {"text": "to", "start": 135.582, "end": 135.682}, {"text": "do", "start": 135.682, "end": 135.822}, {"text": "this.", "start": 135.822, "end": 136.282}]}, {"id": 54, "startTime": 136.682, "endTime": 139.662, "fullText": "Only by counting could humans demonstrate their independence of", "words": [{"text": "Only", "start": 136.682, "end": 136.922}, {"text": "by", "start": 136.922, "end": 137.162}, {"text": "counting", "start": 137.162, "end": 137.542}, {"text": "could", "start": 137.542, "end": 137.762}, {"text": "humans", "start": 137.762, "end": 138.102}, {"text": "demonstrate", "start": 138.102, "end": 138.642}, {"text": "their", "start": 138.642, "end": 138.922}, {"text": "independence", "start": 138.922, "end": 139.302}, {"text": "of", "start": 139.302, "end": 139.662}]}, {"id": 55, "startTime": 139.662, "endTime": 142.562, "fullText": "computers. Come on, said Eddie sternly.", "words": [{"text": "computers.", "start": 139.662, "end": 140.382}, {"text": "Come", "start": 140.722, "end": 140.902}, {"text": "on,", "start": 140.902, "end": 141.582}, {"text": "said", "start": 141.582, "end": 141.762}, {"text": "Eddie", "start": 141.762, "end": 141.922}, {"text": "sternly.", "start": 141.922, "end": 142.562}]}, {"id": 56, "startTime": 142.562, "endTime": 146.662, "fullText": "Computer, began Zaphod. I'm waiting,", "words": [{"text": "Computer,", "start": 142.562, "end": 143.762}, {"text": "began", "start": 143.762, "end": 144.522}, {"text": "Zaphod.", "start": 144.522, "end": 145.422}, {"text": "I'm", "start": 145.982, "end": 146.142}, {"text": "waiting,", "start": 146.142, "end": 146.662}]}, {"id": 57, "startTime": 146.662, "endTime": 149.882, "fullText": "interrupted Eddie. I can wait all day if necessary.", "words": [{"text": "interrupted", "start": 146.662, "end": 147.142}, {"text": "Eddie.", "start": 147.142, "end": 147.722}, {"text": "I", "start": 147.722, "end": 148.082}, {"text": "can", "start": 148.082, "end": 148.262}, {"text": "wait", "start": 148.262, "end": 148.422}, {"text": "all", "start": 148.422, "end": 148.662}, {"text": "day", "start": 148.662, "end": 148.842}, {"text": "if", "start": 148.842, "end": 149.022}, {"text": "necessary.", "start": 149.022, "end": 149.882}]}, {"id": 58, "startTime": 150.102, "endTime": 153.528, "fullText": "Computer, said Zaphod again, who had been trying to", "words": [{"text": "Computer,", "start": 150.102, "end": 151.582}, {"text": "said", "start": 151.582, "end": 151.762}, {"text": "Zaphod", "start": 151.762, "end": 152.202}, {"text": "again,", "start": 152.128, "end": 152.688}, {"text": "who", "start": 152.768, "end": 152.908}, {"text": "had", "start": 152.908, "end": 153.048}, {"text": "been", "start": 153.048, "end": 153.128}, {"text": "trying", "start": 153.128, "end": 153.368}, {"text": "to", "start": 153.368, "end": 153.528}]}, {"id": 59, "startTime": 153.528, "endTime": 155.508, "fullText": "think of some subtle piece of reasoning to put", "words": [{"text": "think", "start": 153.528, "end": 153.728}, {"text": "of", "start": 153.728, "end": 153.868}, {"text": "some", "start": 153.868, "end": 154.028}, {"text": "subtle", "start": 154.028, "end": 154.328}, {"text": "piece", "start": 154.328, "end": 154.588}, {"text": "of", "start": 154.588, "end": 154.808}, {"text": "reasoning", "start": 154.808, "end": 155.108}, {"text": "to", "start": 155.108, "end": 155.368}, {"text": "put", "start": 155.368, "end": 155.508}]}, {"id": 60, "startTime": 155.508, "endTime": 157.968, "fullText": "the computer down with, and had decided not to", "words": [{"text": "the", "start": 155.508, "end": 155.648}, {"text": "computer", "start": 155.648, "end": 155.968}, {"text": "down", "start": 155.968, "end": 156.308}, {"text": "with,", "start": 156.308, "end": 156.668}, {"text": "and", "start": 156.928, "end": 157.068}, {"text": "had", "start": 157.068, "end": 157.168}, {"text": "decided", "start": 157.168, "end": 157.528}, {"text": "not", "start": 157.528, "end": 157.848}, {"text": "to", "start": 157.848, "end": 157.968}]}, {"id": 61, "startTime": 157.968, "endTime": 159.848, "fullText": "bother competing with it on its own ground.", "words": [{"text": "bother", "start": 157.968, "end": 158.208}, {"text": "competing", "start": 158.208, "end": 158.668}, {"text": "with", "start": 158.668, "end": 158.928}, {"text": "it", "start": 158.928, "end": 159.028}, {"text": "on", "start": 159.028, "end": 159.168}, {"text": "its", "start": 159.168, "end": 159.328}, {"text": "own", "start": 159.328, "end": 159.468}, {"text": "ground.", "start": 159.468, "end": 159.848}]}, {"id": 62, "startTime": 160.448, "endTime": 162.588, "fullText": "If you don't open that exit hatch this moment,", "words": [{"text": "If", "start": 160.448, "end": 160.608}, {"text": "you", "start": 160.608, "end": 160.688}, {"text": "don't", "start": 160.688, "end": 160.828}, {"text": "open", "start": 160.828, "end": 161.088}, {"text": "that", "start": 161.088, "end": 161.248}, {"text": "exit", "start": 161.248, "end": 161.608}, {"text": "hatch", "start": 161.608, "end": 161.828}, {"text": "this", "start": 161.828, "end": 162.108}, {"text": "moment,", "start": 162.108, "end": 162.588}]}, {"id": 63, "startTime": 162.588, "endTime": 164.928, "fullText": "I shall zap straight off to your major databanks", "words": [{"text": "I", "start": 162.588, "end": 162.748}, {"text": "shall", "start": 162.748, "end": 162.968}, {"text": "zap", "start": 162.968, "end": 163.268}, {"text": "straight", "start": 163.268, "end": 163.548}, {"text": "off", "start": 163.548, "end": 163.808}, {"text": "to", "start": 163.808, "end": 163.928}, {"text": "your", "start": 163.928, "end": 164.048}, {"text": "major", "start": 164.048, "end": 164.348}, {"text": "databanks", "start": 164.348, "end": 164.928}]}, {"id": 64, "startTime": 164.468, "endTime": 167.328, "fullText": "and reprogram you with a very large axe.", "words": [{"text": "and", "start": 164.468, "end": 165.168}, {"text": "reprogram", "start": 165.168, "end": 165.688}, {"text": "you", "start": 165.688, "end": 165.848}, {"text": "with", "start": 165.848, "end": 166.008}, {"text": "a", "start": 166.008, "end": 166.108}, {"text": "very", "start": 166.108, "end": 166.308}, {"text": "large", "start": 166.308, "end": 166.708}, {"text": "axe.", "start": 166.708, "end": 167.328}]}, {"id": 65, "startTime": 167.328, "endTime": 171.068, "fullText": "Got that? Eddie, shocked, paused and considered this.", "words": [{"text": "Got", "start": 167.328, "end": 167.448}, {"text": "that?", "start": 167.448, "end": 167.908}, {"text": "Eddie,", "start": 167.908, "end": 168.628}, {"text": "shocked,", "start": 168.628, "end": 169.668}, {"text": "paused", "start": 169.668, "end": 169.968}, {"text": "and", "start": 169.968, "end": 170.148}, {"text": "considered", "start": 170.148, "end": 170.508}, {"text": "this.", "start": 170.508, "end": 171.068}]}, {"id": 66, "startTime": 171.448, "endTime": 173.208, "fullText": "Ford carried on counting quietly.", "words": [{"text": "Ford", "start": 171.448, "end": 171.648}, {"text": "carried", "start": 171.648, "end": 172.028}, {"text": "on", "start": 172.028, "end": 172.228}, {"text": "counting", "start": 172.228, "end": 172.548}, {"text": "quietly.", "start": 172.548, "end": 173.208}]}, {"id": 67, "startTime": 173.568, "endTime": 175.388, "fullText": "This is about the most aggressive thing you can", "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 173.568, "end": 173.708}, {"text": "is", "start": 173.708, "end": 173.848}, {"text": "about", "start": 173.848, "end": 174.028}, {"text": "the", "start": 174.028, "end": 174.208}, {"t